---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="What SafeAI.watch does and does not collect: no accounts, no analytics, no cookies set by the site, and static pages served by Vercel."
  intro="SafeAI.watch has no accounts, newsletter form, analytics service, advertising, or payment flow. The site sets no cookies."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <section aria-labelledby="site-heading">
      <h2 id="site-heading">What the site does</h2>
      <p>
        Every page is a static file, built in advance and served as is. Fonts, images, and scripts load
        from this site; pages make no requests to other services. The timeline runs in your browser, and
        your selections are not stored after you leave the page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="hosting-heading">
      <h2 id="hosting-heading">Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The site is hosted on Vercel. To deliver pages and protect its service, Vercel processes the
        technical details of each request, such as your IP address, the page requested, and your browser
        type, and may keep them in standard server logs.{' '}
        <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vercel's privacy policy<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>{' '}
        describes how it handles that data.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="links-heading">
      <h2 id="links-heading">Links to other publishers</h2>
      <p>
        Links to research, reporting, and videos take you to other publishers. Those sites apply their
        own privacy practices, which this page does not cover.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
